  "details": "With all these new open beta features that require other open beta users to test or visualize, there should be a simple tag on nameplates that simply says \"Open-Beta\" or something similar that states if a user is on the open beta or not, and this tag only shows up if you are also using open beta to not be invasive for non-beta users. This will make it easier to test physical open beta features that require user interaction without the need to manually find someone in the discord, among some other use cases.",
